.TH VOCABULARY 1
.SH NAME
vocabulary \- vocabulary quiz
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/vocabulary
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Vocabulary
is a vocabulary quiz.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Choose which of four words matches the prompt. Keys 1–4 select; n asks another question.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B 1-4 / buttons
Select choice
.TP
.B n
Next question
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /lib/temple/vocab.txt
Data file.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/vocabulary.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
